WEBVTT

00:03:58.859 --> 00:04:01.570
So you're asking yourself: What is an NFT?

00:04:02.488 --> 00:04:06.325
It's a certificate of ownership
registered on the blockchain

00:04:06.367 --> 00:04:07.868
for everyone to see.

00:04:08.577 --> 00:04:11.497
It's not too dissimilar
to the deed you get

00:04:11.539 --> 00:04:13.541
when you buy a house
in the physical world.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:19.672
But instead of a house, an NFT denotes
ownership of a file on the internet.

00:04:20.464 --> 00:04:22.758
And unlike copyright or watermarks,

00:04:22.758 --> 00:04:26.887
which are ancient technologies
rooted in bygone eras,

00:04:26.887 --> 00:04:28.723
NFTs are internet native.

00:04:28.764 --> 00:04:32.101
They are born of the internet
for the internet.